#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:2
msgid "TEST_INCLUDE_FILES"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:6
msgid ""
"This directory property specifies a list of CMake scripts to be included and "
"processed when ``ctest`` runs on the directory.  Use absolute paths, to "
"avoid ambiguity.  Script files are included in the specified order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:10
msgid ""
"``TEST_INCLUDE_FILES`` scripts are processed when running ``ctest``, not "
"during the ``cmake`` configuration phase.  These scripts should be written "
"as if they were CTest dashboard scripts.  It is common to generate such "
"scripts dynamically since many variables and commands available during "
"configuration are not accessible at test phase."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:18
msgid ""
"Include paths may use :manual:`generator expressions <cmake-generator-"
"expressions(7)>`.  This is most useful with :prop_gbl:`multi-config "
"generators <GENERATOR_IS_MULTI_CONFIG>`, where a ``$<CONFIG>``-parameterized "
"path selects a different script per configuration.  On multi-config "
"generators, an entry whose evaluated result varies by configuration is "
"emitted under a per-configuration guard, so it is included only for the "
"matching ``ctest -C <config>`` run.  A path whose result is the same for all "
"configurations is included unconditionally."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:27
msgid "No build dependency is added for targets referenced in an include path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:30
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:32
msgid "Setting this directory property to append one or more CMake scripts:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:34
#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:57
msgid "CMakeLists.txt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:34
msgid ""
"configure_file(script.cmake.in script.cmake)\n"
"\n"
"set_property(\n"
"  DIRECTORY\n"
"  APPEND\n"
"  PROPERTY TEST_INCLUDE_FILES\n"
"    ${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/script.cmake\n"
"    ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/foo.cmake\n"
"    ${dir}/bar.cmake\n"
")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:48
msgid "script.cmake.in"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:48
msgid ""
"execute_process(\n"
"  COMMAND \"@CMAKE_COMMAND@\" -E echo \"script.cmake executed during "
"CTest\"\n"
")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:55
msgid "Selecting a per-configuration script with a generator expression:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_dir/TEST_INCLUDE_FILES.rst:57
msgid ""
"file(GENERATE\n"
"  OUTPUT \"props_$<CONFIG>.cmake\"\n"
"  CONTENT \"set_tests_properties(some.test PROPERTIES LABELS \\\"$<CONFIG>\\"
"\")\\n\"\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"set_property(\n"
"  DIRECTORY\n"
"  APPEND\n"
"  PROPERTY TEST_INCLUDE_FILES\n"
"    \"${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/props_$<CONFIG>.cmake\"\n"
")"
msgstr ""
